## 🔌 **API Endpoints**

### **Base URL**
```
Development: http://localhost:5000/api
Production: https://api.sparkinvestment.com/api
```

### **Authentication Endpoints**

| Endpoint | Method | Auth | Description | Request Body | Response |
|----------|--------|------|-------------|--------------|----------|
| `/health` | GET | ❌ | Health check | - | `{ success, message, timestamp, uptime }` |
| `/auth/signup` | POST | ❌ | Register new user | `{ name, email, password, phone, acceptedTerms }` | `{ success, message, data: { user, token, refreshToken } }` |
| `/auth/login` | POST | ❌ | Login user | `{ email, password }` | `{ success, message, data: { user, token, refreshToken } }` |
| `/auth/me` | GET | ✅ | Get current user | - | `{ success, data: { user } }` |
| `/auth/logout` | POST | ✅ | Logout user | - | `{ success, message }` |

